      "A RAMP, NOT A SPIN: <code>L = .9 − p × .5</code>, <code>C = .05 + sin(pπ) × .105</code>, <code>H = base + i × step</code> with step 16–34°. Chroma peaks in the middle because a very light and a very dark colour cannot be vivid — asking for it is what makes generated palettes chalky at one end and muddy at the other.",
